<title>HUNGARY: GARDENIA H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 120 MLN.</title>
<headline>GARDENIA H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 120 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 97	  vs     165</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  145	  vs     105</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	120	  vs	80</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     1,892	  vs   1,542</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	    37	  vs	43</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	 903	  vs     786</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     806	  vs     548</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    123	  vs	86</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  154 profit vs	72 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	   216	  vs	 2</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	62	  vs	74</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    106 loss   vs	12 profit</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	85	  vs	14</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure 191	  vs	 2</p>
<p>    Taxation			   25	  vs	25</p>
<p>NOTE - Gardenia Csipkefuggonygyar Rt is a curtain</p>
<p>manufacturer. </p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were</p>
<p>calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
